 and one for live, determined by the\nAPI token.",[196,205,206,207,211,212,215,216,219,220,223],{},"The signing ",[208,209,210],"code",{},"secret"," you provide is ",[200,213,214],{},"write-only",": it is sent on create/update\nbut is never returned in any response. Store the value you send — you use it to\nverify the ",[208,217,218],{},"Vatly-Signature"," HMAC on deliveries (see ",[221,222,38],"a",{"href":146},").",[225,226,228],"h2",{"id":227},"the-webhookendpoint-resource","The WebhookEndpoint Resource",[196,230,231],{},"Below you'll find all properties for the Vatly WebhookEndpoint resource.",[233,234,236],"h3",{"id":235},"properties","Properties",[238,239,240,256],"table",{},[241,242,243],"thead",{},[244,245,246,250,253],"tr",{},[247,248,249],"th",{},"Name",[247,251,252],{},"Type",[247,254,255],{},"Description",[257,258,259,278,296,311,325,339],"tbody",{},[244,260,261,267,272],{},[262,263,264],"td",{},[208,265,266],{},"id",[262,268,269],{},[208,270,271],{},"string",[262,273,274,275,223],{},"Unique identifier for the endpoint (",[208,276,277],{},"webhook_...",[244,279,280,285,289],{},[262,281,282],{},[208,283,284],{},"resource",[262,286,287],{},[208,288,271],{},[262,290,291,292,295],{},"Resource type, always ",[208,293,294],{},"webhook_endpoint",".",[244,297,298,303,308],{},[262,299,300],{},[208,301,302],{},"testmode",[262,304,305],{},[208,306,307],{},"bool",[262,309,310],{},"Whether this endpoint receives test-mode events.",[244,312,313,318,322],{},[262,314,315],{},[208,316,317],{},"url",[262,319,320],{},[208,321,271],{},[262,323,324],{},"The HTTPS URL deliveries are POSTed to.",[244,326,327,332,336],{},[262,328,329],{},[208,330,331],{},"createdAt",[262,333,334],{},[208,335,271],{},[262,337,338],{},"Creation timestamp (ISO 8601).",[244,340,341,346,351],{},[262,342,343],{},[208,344,345],{},"links",[262,347,348],{},[208,349,350],{},"WebhookEndpointLinks",[262,352,353,354,223],{},"HATEOAS links (",[208,355,356],{},"self",[358,359,360],"blockquote",{},[196,361,206,362,364],{},[208,363,210],{}," is never present on the resource — it is write-only.",[366,367],"hr",{},[225,369,371],{"id":370},"register-a-webhook-endpoint","Register a webhook endpoint",[196,373,374],{},[208,375,376],{},"POST /v1/webhook-endpoints",[196,378,379,380,383],{},"Register the endpoint for the mode determined by the API token. Vatly sends a\n",[208,381,382],{},"webhook.setup"," verification ping to the URL and validates its SSL certificate;\nif either fails the request is rejected. Registering a second endpoint for a mode\nthat already has one is rejected — update or delete the existing one instead.",[233,385,387],{"id":386},"required-attributes","Required attributes",[238,389,390,400],{},[241,391,392],{},[244,393,394,396,398],{},[247,395,249],{},[247,397,252],{},[247,399,255],{},[257,401,402,419],{},[244,403,404,408,412],{},[262,405,406],{},[208,407,317],{},[262,409,410],{},[208,411,271],{},[262,413,414,415,418],{},"Publicly reachable HTTPS URL with a valid SSL certificate. ",[208,416,417],{},"localhost","/loopback addresses are not allowed.",[244,420,421,425,429],{},[262,422,423],{},[208,424,210],{},[262,426,427],{},[208,428,271],{},[262,430,431],{},"Signing secret (min 10 chars). Write-only — keep this value, the API never returns it.",[433,434,438],"pre",{"className":435,"code":436,"language":437,"meta":109,"style":109},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","$endpoint = $vatly->webhookEndpoints->create([\n    'url' => 'https://merchant.example/webhooks/vatly',\n    'secret' => getenv('VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET'), // min 10 chars, keep it — never returned\n]);\n\necho $endpoint->id;  // webhook_...\necho $endpoint->url;\n","php",[208,439,440,477,503,534,540,547,568],{"__ignoreMap":109},[441,442,445,449,453,456,459,462,465,468,470,474],"span",{"class":443,"line":444},"line",1,[441,446,448],{"class":447},"sMK4o","$",[441,450,452],{"class":451},"sTEyZ","endpoint ",[441,454,455],{"class":447},"=",[441,